    "text": "14 hours ago Chester County Independent Publisher Victor Parkins attended the Kiplinger Fellowship program from May 11 to 14 at the E.W. Scripps School of Journalism at Ohio University in Athens, Ohio. The Kiplinger Fellowship is designed to help journalists covering critical issues better prepare for the challenges ahead. The 2026 fellowship focused... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
